Experiment scripts in this repository build on the public Doppelganger-JC
codebase by Yuka Kitamura, Jiahao Huang, and Akiko Aizawa, retrieved from
https://github.com/0017-alt/Doppelganger-JC at commit
eb1c4f3f17403af238046bf218dc49643bc2e2e2. The upstream authors designate
their code as Apache License 2.0.

The upstream benchmark data are not relicensed here. The cognate and question
files remain subject to the data terms identified by the upstream authors.
The bootstrap helper retrieves those files from their authoritative repository.
